e\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-1e47c4ad-da94-4177-a054-6d1c2bab6bc5\"><b>​✔️ 일시</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-81ebd94b-7b7d-4c9e-b4bd-176ceed74324\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-05f7576a-ac0f-4d26-8cc8-5ba66a59a8d5\">- 9/17(수) 16:00 ~ 17:30 경</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-395a3a7f-18b1-4c3f-b304-06891bd3f554\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-7e7e0258-6d49-45fd-ac65-be55c75cf427\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e899e9b0-f466-4243-a41d-1dcafe5e10c9\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-9f2129c6-8517-4661-838e-e055c1cdc84d\"><b>​✔️ 내용</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7a8e7c1b-07ed-4cc8-b2b2-73fa01b98878\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-7e9e1402-b3eb-472b-adb2-078fc17ba944\">1. 솔로 레이드에서 마더 웨일과 전투 중, 특정 상황에서 전투 패턴이 의도와 다르게 동작하는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f7bb5f9f-eb82-4ed5-abb1-fb0bb2aeeb96\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-7eff4ba8-61ec-4e32-9ebc-765ea357fcc8\">2. 소장품 관리 시 일시적으로 연출이 어색한 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-53c41c1f-0f79-466f-9234-69fb763e9074\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e023f7f2-fe62-4f13-8e05-22252410fc7c\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --